menu "Kenko application"

    config KENKO_STATE_TASK_STACK
        int "State machine task stack size"
        default 4096

    config KENKO_STATE_TASK_PRIORITY
        int "State machine task priority"
        default 6

    config KENKO_REBOOT_GRACE_MS
        int "Delay before restarting (ms)"
        default 800
        help
            留给 HTTP 响应发完的时间，否则前端只会看到连接被重置。

endmenu
